libusbhsfs at 625269b7725a6e2a3f2724e8d45b602c1b20ead5, patched for SafeHouse's Switch installer (cmake/usbhsfs.cmake):
- a USB Attached SCSI transport (source/usbhsfs_uasp.c, ISC), used when a drive offers it, with the Bulk-Only
  interface as the fallback, and its state cleaned up after a drive reset;
- FatFs's diskio context published before a volume mounts and cleared after it unmounts, without taking the manager
  lock under the drive lock, and a volume root's stat answered by the mount itself;
- the two USB request enums left to the libnx releases that declare them (USBHSFS_LIBNX_USB_REQUEST_ENUMS).

